From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 09/14] FreeChat: server-wide retention cap
 (FREECHAT_MAX_RETENTION_SECS)

New messages expire at the earlier of the room TTL and the cap; an hourly
sweep (and one at startup) purges older history in every room, keeping state.
---
 src/service/rooms/disappearing/mod.rs   | 124 ++++++++++++++++++++++--
 src/service/rooms/disappearing/tests.rs |  11 ++-
 2 files changed, 126 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

